WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:01.680
Hello everybody!

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.820
We are Pongfinity

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.420
Welcome to a new episode of "Challenge Pongfinity"

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.120
Let's see what kind of challenges you guys have come up with this time!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.720
This idea is from Jacob Knott

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.660
Otto, are you ready for this?

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:15.660
I'm ready!

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.200
You are really high up!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.500
I feel like I'm riding a dinosaur!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.200
Right in the face!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:41.780
Okay, I got this!

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:44.660
I got this!

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.300
You got that one? - Yes!

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.680
We need another person on my shoulders!

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:25.300
We have had strangely many suggestions
that we should play with our hands

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.100
So, we are finally doing it!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.540
Ouch!

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.640
That's actually pretty painful!

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.940
We are trying to shoot the apple with our table tennis bat

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.320
Onto the knife

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:00.640
And see if we can slice it

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.620
I think that I broke the apple

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:17.340
I think I sliced it!

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.160
Perfect slice!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.480
Almost in the middle

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.320
I can't believe this actually worked!

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.320
Remember to subscribe here

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.320
And check out our previous
episodes there!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:36.740
Until next time!

